WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.738
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:09.075
During yesterday's annual
White House turkey pardoning,

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.745
President Biden joked that
the only red wave this season

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:16.382
would be if his dog knocked over
the cranberry sauce.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.550
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.052
Oof.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.387
It's too bad his dog didn't have
the presence of mind

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.389
to knock over the microphone.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:24.724
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.227
A cranberry sauce red wave?

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.394
[ Laughing ]

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:31.231
It would be the slowest
wave ever, just...

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.899
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.569
During yesterday's event,
President Biden said

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.037
it was important to remember

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.873
the true meaning
of Thanksgiving --

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.874
getting high
with your weird cousins

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:44.210
when things get
too tense inside.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.878
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.147
President Biden is reportedly
planning to use the month

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.482
between Thanksgiving and
Christmas to make a decision

00:00:50.482 --> 00:00:51.951
about running in 2024.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.353
Well, whatever you think of him,
it's impressive

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.190
that an 80-year-old man
is planning that far ahead.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.257
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:00.259
If I was 80,
I don't think I'd even

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:03.263
start bingeing a show
that had more than one season.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.265
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.767
Make sure it was a British show.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.268
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:10.269
In a new interview,

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:12.939
Congressman-Elect
Maxwell Frost said

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.907
despite being 80 years old,
President Biden

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.243
can adequately represent Gen Z

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.245
because Biden also knows
what it's like

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.414
to live in a house
you'll never own.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.416
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:27.287
Dr. Anthony Fauci today gave
what is likely his last

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.955
coronavirus briefing
before retiring

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:29.989
at the end of the year.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.658
And you can tell
he's kind of given up

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:32.992
because he gave the briefing

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.327
from a rave.

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.329
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:39.165
According to the latest numbers,
home heating costs are expected

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.834
to increase this year
by nearly 30%.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.669
And now that you're all
caught up with Dad,

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.505
Mom would like to say hi.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.673
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:49.842
In a new interview,
Harrison Ford said that

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.745
in the upcoming installment of
the "Indiana Jones" franchise,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:55.247
he will be digitally altered
to appear younger.

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:58.251
'Cause it's not like that
earring was doing the trick.

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.353
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.524
New York City
is auctioning off gifts

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:06.859
that were given
to former mayors,

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.695
including
a New York Yankees clock

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:10.697
given to former Mayor
Rudy Giuliani.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.864
He doesn't need it anymore,

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:14.367
'cause it's always
five o'clock somewhere.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.870
A man in Missouri recently
pleaded guilty

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.874
to robbing a bank last year
by writing a demand note

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:23.376
on the back of his own
birth certificate

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.045
while wearing an ankle monitor
for a prior offense.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:30.049
Wow, that case should only take
Merrick Garland about a year.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.550
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.386
Rapper Snoop Dogg recently
launched a pet accessory line

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:36.889
called Snoop Doggie Doggs,
which includes

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:38.724
plush toys, bowls, and leashes.

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:39.726
Even crazier,

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.061
he hadn't done that already.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.730
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.566
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:49.135
According to a new survey,
11% of Americans said

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.970
that they find the sound
of a baby's laugh relaxing,

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.973
while the other 89% said,

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.309
"Oh, damn it, the baby's awake."

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:59.312
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.514
"Laugh it up,
you [bleep] monster!"

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.817
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.153
"Oh, what, you don't have
work tomorrow?"

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.588
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.588 --> 00:03:11.757
And finally,
the gas station chain Sheetz

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:12.925
launched a promotion this week

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:15.361
to lower the price
of a gallon of gasoline

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:16.529
to just under $2.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:19.532
Of course, you gotta buy
a hot dog, too.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.001
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:23.670
Math joke!

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.171
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.739
That was a monologue.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:27.740
[ Cheers and applause ]

